\title{mht: Menopausal hormone therapy exposure definitions for Swedish registry data}
\description{
Derives menopausal hormone therapy (MHT) exposure from Swedish prescription
registry (LMED) data. `mht` categorises dispensed product names into MHT
groups. It corrects dispensed durations. It bridges gaps between consecutive
prescriptions. It then applies the approach-based exposure definitions used
by the Skalkidou-lab MHT studies to person-week skeletons.
